<title>USA: Medusa sees plants running at capacity.</title>
<headline>Medusa sees plants running at capacity.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medusa Corp said Thursday it remains optimistic that its cement plants will continue to operate at &quot;practical capacity&quot; for the remainder of 1997.</p>
<p>The company also said it expects its cement shipments for the year will exceed 1996 levels.</p>
<p>Medusa made the comments in a statement announcing its second quarter earnings of $1.09 per share, up from $0.93 on a primary basis and $0.87 on a fully diluted basis last year.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610))</p>
